{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/2026-07-24-hobbies-a1/audio/main-776dbc880a19.mp3","durationSec":161.736,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":5.02,"text":"A hobby is a regular activity that a person does for fun, not for money."},{"start":5.72,"end":6.74,"text":"You choose it yourself."},{"start":7.52,"end":12.76,"text":"For example, a girl named Sara collects small smooth stones from parks and beaches."},{"start":13.54,"end":15.4,"text":"She keeps them in a jar on her desk."},{"start":16.18,"end":20.58,"text":"A boy named Leo draws cartoon animals in a notebook every evening."},{"start":21.48,"end":26.7,"text":"Neither Sara nor Leo is paid for these things — they do them because they like to."},{"start":27.38,"end":29.06,"text":"That is what makes something a hobby."},{"start":29.78,"end":31.38,"text":"Hobbies come in many types."},{"start":32.4,"end":36.58,"text":"Creative hobbies include drawing, painting, and making things by hand."},{"start":36.58,"end":40.8,"text":"Active hobbies include walking, swimming, and dancing."},{"start":41.78,"end":46.5,"text":"Collecting hobbies mean gathering objects like stamps, coins, or plants."},{"start":47.48,"end":52.98,"text":"Social hobbies are done with other people, such as playing board games or joining a cooking group."},{"start":53.8,"end":62.7,"text":"Learning hobbies help you know more — for example, a man named Hiro reads one short history book every month just because he finds it interesting."},{"start":63.58,"end":65.26,"text":"Choosing a hobby is not hard."},{"start":65.84,"end":69.72,"text":"Start by asking: what do I like to look at, make, or do?"},{"start":70.4,"end":79.12,"text":"A woman named Mia tried three things in one month — she painted once, she baked bread, and she walked in a local park."},{"start":79.74,"end":82.96,"text":"She liked baking the most, so she kept doing it."},{"start":83.44,"end":86.8,"text":"You do not need special tools or money to start."},{"start":87.68,"end":89.32,"text":"Try something small and easy."},{"start":89.94,"end":91.62,"text":"If you enjoy it, continue."},{"start":92.28,"end":94.74,"text":"If you do not, try something different."},{"start":95.52,"end":96.84,"text":"It is fine to change."},{"start":97.52,"end":100.18,"text":"Many people think they have no time for a hobby."},{"start":100.74,"end":103.26,"text":"But a hobby does not need a lot of time."},{"start":103.94,"end":107.54,"text":"Even fifteen or twenty minutes a day is enough to start."},{"start":107.54,"end":113.78,"text":"A teenager named Yuki plays guitar for twenty minutes before dinner every evening."},{"start":114.46,"end":118.44,"text":"She does not practice for hours — just a short, regular time."},{"start":119.12,"end":123.18,"text":"A short daily habit is better than a very long session once a month."},{"start":123.78,"end":128.9,"text":"You can also use small pieces of free time, like a bus ride or a lunch break."},{"start":129.96,"end":131.9,"text":"Hobbies do more than fill free time."},{"start":132.42,"end":135.04,"text":"They help people feel calmer and less stressed."},{"start":135.7,"end":140.1,"text":"When you focus on something you enjoy, your mind rests from worries."},{"start":141.08,"end":144.34,"text":"Hobbies also help you meet people who like the same things."},{"start":145,"end":149.9,"text":"A man named Dan joined a small online group for people who draw maps by hand."},{"start":150.5,"end":152.7,"text":"He did not know anyone there at first."},{"start":153.32,"end":157.02,"text":"After a few months, he had three new friends from different countries."},{"start":157.72,"end":161.32,"text":"A hobby can quietly improve your life in more than one way."}],"words":[{"text":"A","start":0,"end":0.44},{"text":"hobby","start":0.44,"end":0.76},{"text":"is","start":0.76,"end":1.1},{"text":"a","start":1.1,"end":1.26},{"text":"regular","start":1.26,"end":1.58},{"text":"activity","start":1.58,"end":2.24},{"text":"that","start